{
    "title": "NIV Bible",
    "description": "Welcome to the NIV Bible & Devotional!\r\n\r\nThis special NIV Bible app (brought to you by Biblica & Zondervan) allows you to stream and download for FREE the complete New International Version text and gives you full-access to many popular NIV Bibles to try for a limited time. \r\n\r\nThe NIV is the most widely read and trusted Bible translation in contemporary English. The NIV delivers the very best combination of accuracy, readability, and clarity, making it easy to read and easy to understand. \r\n\r\nIf you would like to learn more about Biblica\u2019s ministry across the globe or support their work, please visit Biblica.com. For more information about the NIV translation, please visit theNIVBible.com.\r\n\r\nAbout the New International Version (NIV):\r\n\r\nThe NIV Bible is\u2026\r\n\r\nAccurate.\r\nThe NIV translators are united by their conviction that the Bible is God\u2019s inspired Word. That, along with their individual expertise and years of studying biblical languages, helps them to capture subtle nuances and the depth of meaning in the Bible.\r\n\r\nReadable.\r\nThe NIV text has been carefully and thoughtfully designed to provide the best reading experience possible. Each phrase has been purposefully crafted with the end user in mind, and the NIV\u2019s 8th- grade reading level makes it accessible to most English readers around the world. \r\n\r\nClear.\r\nThe Bible should be every bit as clear to you as it was to its original audience. The NIV translators take great care to balance accuracy, readability, and clarity using global English as it is spoken today.\r\n\r\nBeautiful.\r\nThe NIV translators also prioritize literary beauty, resulting in a Bible translation that\u2019s suitable for both private and public reading.\r\n\r\nTrustworthy.\r\nThe NIV is translated by an independent, self-governing team of Bible scholars using the oldest and most reliable Bible manuscripts available today. No publisher, ministry, or other group can tell the committee how to translate God\u2019s Word and there are safeguards in place to avoid theological bias. \r\n\r\nApp Features:\r\nStream and download the NIV FREE for offline use. Begin your day with a daily verse and devotional reminder. Find Scripture easily using a word or phrase. Personalize your Bible reading experience by using highlights, margin notes and study with multiple views. Listen to the Bible with text-to-speech audio and take notes with our journal rich-text editor. As an additional bonus, stream for free the New International Reader's Version (NIrV) and the Spanish translation, Nueva Versi\u00f3n Internacional (NVI). \r\n\r\nOver thirty Study Bibles and Commentary, including the top selling NIV Study Bible. Other study titles include NIV Cultural Backgrounds Study Bible, NIV Biblical Theology Study Bible, Celebrate Recovery Bible, NIV Streams in the Desert Bible, NIV Essentials Study Bible, NIV Faith and Work Bible, NIV Foundation Study Bible, NIV Quest Study Bible, NIV Life Journey Bible, NIV Lifehacks Bible, NIV MacArthur Study Bible, NIV Bible Study Commentary and more. \r\n\r\nOther features include the ability to start a group plan or prayer list with family and friends, share verses via email, text, Twitter or Facebook, dark or light mode, creating custom reading plans, change font styles and sizes and sync across your favorite devices (phone, tablet and web).\r\n\r\nHave app questions or feature suggestions? Contact us at support@nivapp.bible\r\nSee our terms at https://tecarta.com/terms",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to the NIV Bible &amp; Devotional!<br><br>This special NIV Bible app (brought to you by Biblica &amp; Zondervan) allows you to stream and download for FREE the complete New International Version text and gives you full-access to many popular NIV Bibles to try for a limited time. <br><br>The NIV is the most widely read and trusted Bible translation in contemporary English. The NIV delivers the very best combination of accuracy, readability, and clarity, making it easy to read and easy to understand. <br><br>If you would like to learn more about Biblica\u2019s ministry across the globe or support their work, please visit Biblica.com. For more information about the NIV translation, please visit theNIVBible.com.<br><br>About the New International Version (NIV):<br><br>The NIV Bible is\u2026<br><br>Accurate.<br>The NIV translators are united by their conviction that the Bible is God\u2019s inspired Word. That, along with their individual expertise and years of studying biblical languages, helps them to capture subtle nuances and the depth of meaning in the Bible.<br><br>Readable.<br>The NIV text has been carefully and thoughtfully designed to provide the best reading experience possible. Each phrase has been purposefully crafted with the end user in mind, and the NIV\u2019s 8th- grade reading level makes it accessible to most English readers around the world. <br><br>Clear.<br>The Bible should be every bit as clear to you as it was to its original audience. The NIV translators take great care to balance accuracy, readability, and clarity using global English as it is spoken today.<br><br>Beautiful.<br>The NIV translators also prioritize literary beauty, resulting in a Bible translation that\u2019s suitable for both private and public reading.<br><br>Trustworthy.<br>The NIV is translated by an independent, self-governing team of Bible scholars using the oldest and most reliable Bible manuscripts available today. No publisher, ministry, or other group can tell the committee how to translate God\u2019s Word and there are safeguards in place to avoid theological bias. <br><br>App Features:<br>Stream and download the NIV FREE for offline use. Begin your day with a daily verse and devotional reminder. Find Scripture easily using a word or phrase. Personalize your Bible reading experience by using highlights, margin notes and study with multiple views. Listen to the Bible with text-to-speech audio and take notes with our journal rich-text editor. As an additional bonus, stream for free the New International Reader&#39;s Version (NIrV) and the Spanish translation, Nueva Versi\u00f3n Internacional (NVI). <br><br>Over thirty Study Bibles and Commentary, including the top selling NIV Study Bible. Other study titles include NIV Cultural Backgrounds Study Bible, NIV Biblical Theology Study Bible, Celebrate Recovery Bible, NIV Streams in the Desert Bible, NIV Essentials Study Bible, NIV Faith and Work Bible, NIV Foundation Study Bible, NIV Quest Study Bible, NIV Life Journey Bible, NIV Lifehacks Bible, NIV MacArthur Study Bible, NIV Bible Study Commentary and more. <br><br>Other features include the ability to start a group plan or prayer list with family and friends, share verses via email, text, Twitter or Facebook, dark or light mode, creating custom reading plans, change font styles and sizes and sync across your favorite devices (phone, tablet and web).<br><br>Have app questions or feature suggestions? Contact us at support@nivapp.bible<br>See our terms at https://tecarta.com/terms",
